              "text": "120 children are asked how they travel to school.",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Two-thirds of those asked are boys.",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "26 girls walk to school.",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Twice as many boys don’t-walk to school as girls.",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Use a two-way table to work out how many boys walk to school.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
